		{
			dependencies: ["5A7BA6549A3327C6"]
			description: ["The refinery clads the strand; a pasta draw bench then pulls it into &6Kerr Strand Wire&r. This wire is the MAX+ cable, and it carries the coils and the casing. The line stops at the wire: later steps coat it, braid it and wind it."]
