		{
			dependencies: ["18A230554D5B4FC6", "178016B5CE2D0AEB"]
			description: ["There is no MAX+ hull block. Machines use the MAX &6Machine Hull&r with the &6Horizon Machine Casing&r, which is MAX casing, four compressed plates and strand cable. Every MAX+ controller asks for two casings."]
