		{
			dependencies: ["1009AE6C6D8D0887"]
			description: ["A silicon-28 wafer, spin-stacked on a racetrack fab and cut to size. The &6Horizon Logic Die&r is the logic half of the horizon processor. The calutron for pure silicon-28, crystal growth, the beam-ultraviolet scanner and the racetrack fab, six steps in all. The horizon processor, which asks for two dies. Stock the boules by ME; the cutter returns dies by chest, so give it a buffer."]
			icon: "grindless:horizon_logic_die"
			id: "11FC82811D7ACCC9"
