			title: "Horizon Interposer"
			x: 2.5d
			y: 10.5d
		}
		{
			dependencies: ["11FC82811D7ACCC9", "10AB32F3FA89A75D", "1EBBE33BC966BE23"]
			description: ["The circuit above the top of the ladder. The &6Horizon Processor&r joins two logic dies, an interposer, a quantum memory node, a Rydberg logic array, two mainframes and condensate. The UEV photonic integration hall at the top voltage, and one of every older part, with kerr condensate from the shell. Every MAX+ component and controller. A controller asks for eight; the Hyperstargate asks for sixteen. Six inputs on six chests; a missing one stalls the hall, so alarm on the stock."]
			icon: "grindless:horizon_processor"
			id: "57A1D900439A0E96"
			rewards: [{ id: "5CB8D0382045510D", type: "xp", xp: 400 }]
