			description: ["The last component: an emitter, two Kerr Field Coils and a &6Condensate Field Cell&r. The cell is a five-step line that loads a niobium cavity with condensate in the refinery and seals it cold. The &6MAX+ Field Generator&r is what the big machines ask for most."]
